A Democrat must win in 2028; Bitcoin must reach a record height;
$LAPTOP’s fully diluted value—counting every coin—must top $TRUMP outright.
When an outcome missed its deadline, that portion would not disappear;
the matching tokens would go to charity, as the planners made clear.

Yet meme coins may trade from comedy, curiosity, or cheer;
price times all the tokens makes a “market cap” appear.
Another 20% was designated for crypto wallets belonging to $TRUMP losers, Hunter Biden’s Substack subscribers, and people on video journalist Andrew Callaghan’s mailing list.

